WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.019
Hello. I would like two apples and some bread.

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.683
Do you want this bread or this baguette?

00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:08.275
This baguette, please.

00:00:08.525 --> 00:00:10.606
Do you need a bag?

00:00:10.856 --> 00:00:13.501
No, thank you. I have my bag.
